# class: clearances
# origin: B6 of docs/plans/preview-and-remodel/cards.md (a garage whose vehicle door is narrower than a car needs to drive through; no audit plan drew one)
# expect: W_GARAGE_OPENING_UNDERSIZED
# status: done
# fact: d_car is 2000 mm wide, under the 2400 mm one car needs (common practice for a sectional door, not a published standard);
#   r_gar is 6400 deep and 3800 wide, so neither `W_GARAGE_TOO_NARROW` check fires
plan "Garage door undersized" {
  units mm
  grid 50
  wall id=shell exterior thickness 200 { (0,0) (6400,0) (6400,3800) (0,3800) close }
  room id=r_gar at (0,0) size 6400x3800 label "Garage" uses garage
  door id=d_car garage at (0,1900) width 2000 wall shell
}
